<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan overnight rates remain firm.</title>
<headline>Pakistan overnight rates remain firm.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan overnight rates remained at relatively high levels on Friday due to a shortage of funds in the banking system, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight trades were struck at 19.50 percent owing to scarce funds, one dealer said.</p>
<p>Heavy amounts were traded at this level and some even at 20 percent, he said.</p>
<p>The market remained short for the second day, the dealer said. -- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
